{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他带着对那种不必防备的生活的牵挂往前，反倒觉得它近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"牵挂往前\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"以前他一舍不得那种生活，就想退回安宁，仿佛不争取便能把它保住。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想到，自己眼下做的事正是为了那种生活，心里踏实又高兴，连舍不得也不再像拖后腿。\",\n      \"key\": \"为了那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再拼命也未必换得回那种生活，若把累当软弱、逼自己硬撑，反会磨掉他想护住的温柔。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他又尝到当初相信那种生活时的高兴，可那种生活还没回来，他不知道这些努力能护住多少。\",\n      \"key\": \"生活还没回来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，真要付出代价时，也可能又想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"付出代价\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再靠硬撑证明自己该往前，还是愿意为那种生活做事。\",\n      \"key\": \"硬撑证明\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留带着牵挂行动后旧愿反而更近的变化，用平常的说法接住上一段两边都不舍的状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他曾以为退回安宁就能护住旧愿的想法，作为后来改变的前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R67\", \"R68\", \"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿从退路变成行动理由、两种心意共同推动他向前，以及依恋不再像拖累的变化。改成他想到自己正在为那种生活出力时的踏实与高兴，不再用总结口吻宣布两边已经整合。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留努力不保证旧愿实现、行动可能耗损所爱这两层意思，把行动方式的限制落到硬撑会磨掉他想护住的温柔上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日快乐回返、现实尚未改变和努力结果未知这三层意思，让快乐与未实现的愿望同时成立，不把喜悦写成结果保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来仍会疲惫、付出代价时可能动摇的风险，删去两种渴望仍有冲突的抽象总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R75\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-4\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"融入具体经历\",\n      \"why\": \"不再抽象宣布两种需要都要保留，而由牵挂成为行动理由、硬撑可能伤到温柔、旧愿未实现但快乐仍真实来体现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并收束\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再靠硬撑证明自己该向前、仍愿意为那种生活做事的变化，让结尾落在不必加码证明的持续意愿上。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4fd92912-04c7-40b7-9b04-05d55fbedf6a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T201714993028Z", "elapsed_seconds": 332.203, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T20:22:47.208556+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cad86694daad98b237a008d674cecf0ba88cd6e766d74ad1d1d398064ba1d72e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T201714993028Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c8cf5e636ecb408b33c7823f7f6d49a1ee40f0fedbfcc1a4fc6423f3c3fd7d94"}}}
